					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2280113#post-3559216</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2280113/scp-3075#post-3559216</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2017 17:32:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kid F</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2782678</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That child would be of the same genus as their parents, namely <em>H. erectus</em>, which is decidedly not the goal of the -As. They are obsessed with humans and seek to comprehensively modify the human genetic code by mating with them. Thus, the notion of having children amongst themselves is anathema in their eyes.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
